The Top Sample Sources List ranks the most popular movies, TV-series and 
other similar kinds of sample sources. The popularity is based on how 
frequently spoken lines from these sources have been sampled and used in 
some sort of musical context. The Top Sampling Groups List is based on 
the former, but is instead ordered on how frequently groups uses samples 
of spoken lines. These lists have been compiled mainly by the help of and 
contributions from the readers of the Usenet group rec.music.industrial, 
in which these lists once upon a time were born. 

The Top Sample List can now be found on the following locations on the 
Web. Especially I would like you to check out the new advanced browser 
